### Page 2 of 3

```text
The GRANTEE releases and agrees to save and hold harmless GRANTOR, its officers,
agents and employees, from any causes of action or claims or demands arising out of this grant of
easement, except to the extent any such cause of action or claims or demands are the result of the
negligence or willful misconduct of the GRANTOR, its agents, or employees.
GRANTOR shall have the right to use and enjoy the above described premises, subject to
the rights herein granted.
This grant is a covenant running with the land and shall be binding upon the parties hereto,
their heirs, devisees, representatives, successors and assigns; and the rights, privileges and
authorities herein granted shall be assignable together or separately and in whole or in part.
The easement herein contained shall be binding upon the GRANTOR, its heirs, successors
and assigns.
